# repository.
.claude/worktrees/


# === Local sandboxes and scratch work ===
examples/
sandbox/
sandboxes/
tests/sandboxes/

# === Runtime Artifacts (auto-generated, start empty on fresh clone) ===
# Created on first use by /consistency-check and /architecture-review
docs/consistency-failures.md

# === Build Output ===
build/
builds/
bin/
# ...but not an addon's own scripts: gdUnit4's test runner lives in
# addons/gdUnit4/bin/, and without it neither /smoke-check nor CI can run tests.
!addons/gdUnit4/bin/
# Godot generates these when importing the upstream gdUnit4 archive.
/addons/gdUnit4/**/*.gd.uid
/addons/gdUnit4/**/*.import
obj/
out/
dist/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.app

# === Engine: Godot ===
# `**/` matches .godot at any depth (e.g. prototypes/<name>/godot/.godot).
# Everything under .godot/ is regenerated by the editor and by
# `godot --headless --import` (CI runs it before tests), including
# global_script_class_cache.cfg. Tracking that cache made every editor session
# dirty it and blocked `git pull`. On a fresh clone, open the editor or run
# `godot --headless --path . --import` once before running scenes headlessly.
**/.godot/
*.translation
export_presets.cfg
# .import files carry per-asset import settings; commit them.
# Uncomment if using Godot:
# *.import

